      "region": "1层",
      "start_phase": "headless_knight_p1",
      "art_key": "headless_knight",
      "source_description": "1.挥击 (22点伤害)2.连击(6x场上烈火地块数量) 3.野火（给玩家生成2张烈火地块）"
    },
    {
